                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This is a high energy 'shield shoot' were you punch nearby robots, block lasers, and shoot distant robots. Having to match weapons to the enemies adds a nice amount of tension. The enemies, weapons, world, and effects all look great! There's just enough story with good voice acting to keep things interesting.\n\nPerformance gets choppy at times and sometimes the difficulty seems a little too high. Failing a mission means that you hear the same dialog multiple times. Despite these gripes, this is one of the better wave shooters out there, well paced and well designed.",
